":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"今天刚上了一回","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"小流是什么意思","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"那我这种把几个推荐回复复制下来整合到一起去喂的呢","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"57a3d3e46a6a695fd3f82095","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"小流大概就是5000以下的崽崽，我的号就两位数连接，笑死，可能被某野冷藏了，不过这样小流的崽崽好像会灵一点，起码重复少","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"57a3d3e46a6a695fd3f82095","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"呃，应该也可以的，我一般手打，我看他们用推荐好像容易蠢","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"我和我的智能体就没从高速上下来过（bushi）","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"同冷藏+1，我都是个位数","comment_date":"07-28"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"57a3d3e46a6a695fd3f82095","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"这样的体验感最好的，纯聊天不需要他推崽","comment_date":"07-29"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"57a3d3e46a6a695fd3f82095","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"我也是，我这里是细节，各种操作都有，还有长句","comment_date":"07-29"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe2000000001001f6a3","IsParent":"comment-66a6555d0000000009000c24","comment_content":"但是每次🚗后那个事件簿就感觉会强行正经一样，最后一句话必定升华主题（其实其他时候也会只不过🚗后更明显）","comment_date":"07-29"},{"post_id":"6678c80e000000001e012a3b","author_id":"63f1bfe